{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/719623-would-the-god-machine-make-genetic-super-soldiers","id":719623,"title":"Would the god-machine make Genetic-Super Soldiers?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-23T09:33:35-07:00","id":719623,"title":"Would the god-machine make Genetic-Super Soldiers?","content":"Hey guys I wanted to know do you think the god-machine would create an infrastructure that would create genetically upgraded humans to make super-soldiers that could be used as agents or even just more durable bodies that are easier for angels to possess or maybe just making them sleeper agents ?<br /> <br /> Super-soldiers like agent 47 ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 10-23-2015, 12:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T09:52:48-07:00","id":719708,"title":"","content":"The God-Machine creates Angels for specific purposes. They (the Angels) could create cults of humans, which may very likely produce Schismatics among the cult. These followers could have a large list of abilities to choose from, such as being tougher. These cultists will retain those abilities even after the Angel abandons the cult when the mission is done. That powered person may or may not remain loyal. But they still remain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This is just my bright, shiny two cents.<br /> <br /> Here's the thing. I try not to argue in forums. It's like pouring concrete in a river. It doesn't get you anywhere in the short term and it poisons the environment long term.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2668-asmenedas","name":"Asmenedas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2668_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T09:57:03-07:00","id":719717,"title":"","content":"Super soldier programs are exactly the kind of thing the God Machine would be up to. It probably wouldn't make them en masse, usually \u2013 save a small number of super soldiers for covert operations or whatever \u2013 but the God Machine will do pretty much whatever gets it results.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T11:46:25-07:00","id":732721,"title":"","content":"I'd put forth the dissenting opinion. The G-M is more puppet master than conquer, and it has a noted bias towards simply bending existing human projects to suit its own inscrutable ends. A more likely opinion would be another entity trying to enhance soldiers, (in real life DARPA is trying that, albeit using exoskeleton armor) and the G-M either seeding the project with sleeper agents, or sending an Angel to try and steer the project towards its own ends.<br /> <br /> Deva Corp, on the other hand, would be <i>exactly</i> the type to try and pull off enhanced soldiers, as part of their trans-humanist efforts.<br /> <br /> And of course, the Cheiron Group has been there already for a long time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T12:30:08-07:00","id":732817,"title":"","content":"Well it depends on what you mean by supersoldiers.<br /> <br /> The G-M isn't next gen, it's Clarkian &quot;might as well be magic&quot; stage.<br /> <br /> It can already pass out supernatural merits like halloween candy, after all. <br /> <br /> So a supersoldier program would start at the level of telepathy, telekinesis, and psychokinesis and move up from there.<br /> <br /> Less Captain America and more Colonel America. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T13:05:55-07:00","id":732869,"title":"","content":"What about the Knights of St. Adrian from Hunter?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T07:00:31-07:00","id":734611,"title":"","content":"I would think so, though I would think less Universal Soldier and more Jason Bourne.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T07:34:18-07:00","id":734671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/719623-would-the-god-machine-make-genetic-super-soldiers#post719623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey guys I wanted to know do you think the god-machine would create an infrastructure that would create genetically upgraded humans to make super-soldiers that could be used as agents or even just more durable bodies that are easier for angels to possess or maybe just making them sleeper agents ?</div> </div> </div> </div> It already does - that's what Stigmatics are for. That's what specially bred bloodlines are for (the God Machine is all about eugenetics with specific people having kids). In fact, I bet that some angels can only be summoned with specific people from specific bloodlines. So, yeah. Its already part of the game. <br /> <br /> With the G-M focus on secrecy, its very likely the supersoldiers are going to be less soldiers and more super spies, but the same idea applies - the GM breeds ubermench.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T17:13:01-07:00","id":743271,"title":"","content":"My theoretical <b>Demon</b>/<b>Deviant</b> crossover game would kinda be about this. The program wouldn't be run by the God-machine itself but it would be by Daeva Corp","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T21:06:12-07:00","id":743740,"title":"","content":"I believe one of the 'shards'/alternate settings being written up in the Demon Storyteller Guide has you playing one of these as a member of a pseudo-SWAT team that, among other things, hunts down the Unchained.<br /> <br /> So my answer is yes; the God-Machine will happily build super-soldiers out of people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T17:31:34-07:00","id":745395,"title":"","content":"If memory served those are stigmatics altered to have embeds and/or exploits.<br /> <br /> Although since demonblooded can already have embeds, it's easy to picture the G-M harvesting demon DNA to mass produce demonblooded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}